The PostgreSQL contrib tree
---------------------------

minipg note: the whole contrib module set has been cropped away.  The
extensions that used to live here (pageinspect, pg_buffercache,
pg_freespacemap, pg_visibility, ...) all register SQL objects through
CREATE FUNCTION / CREATE AGGREGATE, and that DDL has been removed from
minipg, so none of them could be installed any more.

This directory now only carries contrib-global.mk, the shared build
infrastructure that src/test/modules/*/Makefile still includes.
